<dialog class="modal" id="fPatternModal" aria-labelledby="fPatternModalTitle">
  <div class="modal__header">
    <h2 id="fPatternModalTitle" style="font-size: 1.25rem;">F-Pattern Reading</h2>
    <button type="button" class="icon-btn" id="closeFPatternModal" aria-label="Close dialog">✕</button>
  </div>
  <div class="modal__body">
    <div class="pattern-diagram">
      <div class="fpattern-lines">
        <div class="fpattern-line" style="width:95%;"></div>
        <div class="fpattern-line" style="width:88%;"></div>
        <div class="fpattern-line" style="width:70%;"></div>
        <div class="fpattern-line" style="width:92%;"></div>
        <div class="fpattern-line" style="width:50%;"></div>
        <div class="fpattern-line" style="width:65%;"></div>
        <div class="fpattern-line" style="width:40%;"></div>
        <div class="fpattern-line" style="width:58%;"></div>
        <div class="fpattern-line" style="width:35%;"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="fpattern-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>
    <p>The coral shape is a heatmap, not a decoration. Eyes hit the full top line first, then a shorter second pass, then trail down the left edge scanning for anything worth stopping for. Everything outside that shape gets skimmed or skipped.</p>
    <p><strong>What to do with this:</strong> put your strongest words at the start of the first two lines and down the left edge. Don't bury your point in the middle of a paragraph.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="modal__footer">
    <span></span>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" id="dismissFPatternModal">Got it</button>
  </div>
</dialog>

<dialog class="modal" id="zPatternModal" aria-labelledby="zPatternModalTitle">
  <div class="modal__header">
    <h2 id="zPatternModalTitle" style="font-size: 1.25rem;">Z-Pattern for Landing Pages</h2>
    <button type="button" class="icon-btn" id="closeZPatternModal" aria-label="Close dialog">✕</button>
  </div>
  <div class="modal__body">
    <div class="pattern-diagram zpattern-diagram">
      <div class="zpattern-corner tl">① Logo</div>
      <div class="zpattern-corner tr">② Sign Up</div>
      <div class="zpattern-corner bl">④ Learn More</div>
      <div class="zpattern-corner br">③ Get Started</div>
      <svg class="zpattern-path" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs>
          <marker id="zArrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse">
            <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" style="fill: var(--fixed-ink);" />
          </marker>
        </defs>
        <path d="M8,8 L92,8 L8,92 L88,92" style="stroke: var(--fixed-ink); fill: none;" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 4" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" marker-end="url(#zArrow)" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <p>On pages with more visuals than text, like most landing pages, eyes don't scan line by line. They jump corner to corner: top-left, across to top-right, diagonally down to bottom-left, then across to bottom-right, tracing a Z.</p>
    <p><strong>What to do with this:</strong> put your logo top-left, your account/sign-up link top-right, and your main call-to-action bottom-right, right where the Z ends.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="modal__footer">
    <span></span>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" id="dismissZPatternModal">Got it</button>
  </div>
</dialog>

<dialog class="modal" id="gridPatternModal" aria-labelledby="gridPatternModalTitle">
  <div class="modal__header">
    <h2 id="gridPatternModalTitle" style="font-size: 1.25rem;">The 8pt Grid System</h2>
    <button type="button" class="icon-btn" id="closeGridPatternModal" aria-label="Close dialog">✕</button>
  </div>
  <div class="modal__body">
    <div class="pattern-diagram grid-diagram">
      <div class="grid-demo-card">
        <div class="grid-demo-icon"></div>
        <h4>Card Title</h4>
        <p>16px below the icon, 16px below this line, 16px of padding all around.</p>
        <span class="btn btn--primary" style="font-size:0.85rem; padding:.5em 1em;">Action</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p>Every dot in the grid above is 8px apart. The card's padding, the gap under the icon, and the gap under this paragraph are all exactly 16px, which is 2 dots. Nothing here was placed by eye.</p>
    <p><strong>What to do with this:</strong> before you type a random padding value, ask whether 8, 16, 24, or 32 already does the job. It almost always does.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="modal__footer">
    <span></span>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" id="dismissGridPatternModal">Got it</button>
  </div>
</dialog>

